# shell: desktop
# home: fixture
# prefs: factory
# The toolbar grew past Save and Run: undo and redo, dimmed when there
# is nothing to take back, and find.  Proven by the buttons DOING what
# they show -- the file read back after undo and redo, the find bar
# appearing when its glass is pressed.
wait 25
click 980 30
wait 4
menu-pick Programming
wait 4
menu-pick TikuBasic
wait 150
click 71 8
wait 8
menu-pick Open Project…
wait 40
click 400 220
wait 6
click 675 413
wait 60
click-window Project
wait 8
key Down
wait 8
key Return
wait 90
